<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-Z FEB NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-Z FEB NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.77 vs   0.27</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.22 vs   0.42</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.79 vs   0.64</p>
<p> Sales		   12.85 vs  15.80</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.49 vs   0.67</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.30 vs   0.83</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.91 vs   1.30</p>
<p> Sales		   27.50 vs  27.16</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Mostostal Zabrze SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
